[[File:Braendenaelde.jpg|thumb|right|''[[Urtica dioica]]'']]
{{wikipedia}}
{{wikispecies|Urtica}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|netle}}, {{m|enm|netel}}, from {{inh|en|ang|netle}}, {{m|ang|netele}}, {{m|ang|netel}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*natilā}} (cognate with {{cog|osx|netila}}, {{cog|dum|netele}} (modern {{cog|nl|netel}}), {{cog|de|Nessel}}, Middle {{cog|da|nædlæ||nettle}}), a diminutive of {{der|en|gem-pro|*natǭ}} (of unknown origin, perhaps from the same source as {{m|en|net}}).

